function applyLanguage(code){const d=uiTranslations[code]||uiTranslations.en;save("language",code);["#languageSelect","#toolLanguageSelect"].forEach(sel=>{const el=$(sel);if(el)el.value=code});const nav=$$(".nav-item[data-view]");if(nav[0])nav[0].innerHTML=`<span class="nav-icon">⌂</span> ${d.dashboard} <kbd>1</kbd>`;if(nav[1])nav[1].innerHTML=`<span class="nav-icon">♡</span> ${d.saved}`;if(nav[2])nav[2].innerHTML=`<span class="nav-icon">◷</span> ${d.recent}`;const categoryLabels=[d.image,d.text,d.developer,d.numbers,d.generators,d.productivity];$$("[data-cat]").forEach((el,i)=>{const icon=el.querySelector(".cat-emoji")?.textContent||"";el.innerHTML=`<span class="cat-emoji">${icon}</span>${categoryLabels[i]||el.dataset.cat}`});const crumb=$("#crumbCurrent");if(crumb&&crumb.textContent==="Dashboard")crumb.textContent=d.dashboard;const back=$("#closeTool span");if(back)back.textContent=d.back;const guideTitle=$("#toolGuide .guide-heading h3");if(guideTitle)guideTitle.textContent=`${d.guide}: ${currentTool?.name||""}`;const search=$("#mainSearch");if(search)search.placeholder=d.search;const short=$("#shortcutSearch");if(short)short.childNodes[1]&&(short.childNodes[1].textContent=" "+d.search+" ");const hero=$("#heroExplore");if(hero)hero.firstChild.textContent=d.explore+" ";const note=$("#heroNote");if(note)note.textContent="＋ "+d.quick;document.documentElement.lang=code==="zh"?"zh-CN":code;}
$("#languageSelect").addEventListener("change",e=>applyLanguage(e.target.value));$("#toolLanguageSelect").addEventListener("change",e=>applyLanguage(e.target.value));

function navigateTool(id){
  const t=tools.find(x=>x.id===id); if(!t) return;
  const url=new URL(location.href); url.searchParams.set("tool",id);
  history.pushState({vexakitTool:id},"",url.pathname+url.search+url.hash);
  openTool(id); window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:"smooth"});
}
function openTool(id){let t=tools.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!t)return;currentTool=t;document.body.classList.add("tool-page");document.body.style.overflow="auto";addRecent(id);$("#modalIcon").textContent=t.icon;$("#modalIcon").style.cssText=`--tone:${t.tone};--tint:${t.tint};color:${t.tone};background:${t.tint}`;$("#modalCategory").textContent=t.cat.toUpperCase()+" TOOL";$("#modalTitle").textContent=t.name;$("#modalDescription").textContent=t.desc;$("#favoriteTool").textContent=favs().includes(id)?"♥":"♡";$("#toolWorkspace").innerHTML=toolUI(id);let related=tools.filter(x=>x.cat===t.cat&&x.id!==id).slice(0,4);let extras=document.getElementById("toolRelated");if(!extras){extras=document.createElement("section");extras.id="toolRelated";extras.className="tool-related";$(".tool-modal").appendChild(extras)}extras.innerHTML=`<div class="related-head"><div><small>KEEP YOUR FLOW</small><h3>Related ${t.cat} tools</h3></div><a href="${location.pathname}">Browse all tools ↗</a></div><div class="related-list">${related.map(x=>`<a href="?tool=${x.id}" class="related-item"><span style="--tone:${x.tone};--tint:${x.tint}">${x.icon}</span><b>${x.name}</b><i>↗</i></a>`).join("")}</div>`;$("#toolOverlay").classList.add("open");$("#toolOverlay").setAttribute("aria-hidden","false");document.body.style.overflow="auto";renderToolGuide(id);wireTool(id);applyLanguage(load("language","en"));window.scrollTo(0,0)}
function hideToolView(){
  if(focusInterval){clearInterval(focusInterval);focusInterval=null;}
  $("#toolOverlay").classList.remove("open");
  $("#toolOverlay").setAttribute("aria-hidden","true");
  document.body.style.overflow=""; document.body.classList.remove("tool-page"); currentTool=null;
}
function closeTool(){
  const url=new URL(location.href);
  if(url.searchParams.has("tool")){
    url.searchParams.delete("tool"); history.pushState({},"",url.pathname+url.search+url.hash);
  }
  hideToolView();
}
window.addEventListener("popstate",()=>{
  const id=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get("tool");
  if(id && tools.some(t=>t.id===id)){openTool(id);}
  else hideToolView();
});
// Related-tool links stay inside the app and open the selected tool immediately.
document.addEventListener("click",e=>{
  const link=e.target.closest("a.related-item");
  if(link){e.preventDefault();const id=new URL(link.href).searchParams.get("tool");if(id)navigateTool(id);}
});
function toolUI(id){switch(id){
case"compress":case"resize":case"convert":case"crop":return `<div class="dropzone"><strong>Choose an image to get started</strong>Files stay on this device. JPG, PNG, WebP supported.<input id="imgFile" type="file" accept="image/*"></div><div id="imgControls" hidden><img id="imgPreview" class="preview-image"><div class="field-grid">${id==="compress"?field("Quality (0.1–1)","quality","","number","0.78"):id==="resize"?field("Width (px)","width","","number","800")+field("Height (px)","height","","number","600"):id==="convert"?`<div class="field"><label>OUTPUT FORMAT</label><select id="format"><option value="image/webp">WebP</option><option value="image/jpeg">JPEG</option><option value="image/png">PNG</option></select></div>`:`<div class="field"><label>Aspect ratio</label><select id="aspect"><option value="free">Free crop (center)</option><option value="1">Square 1:1</option><option value="1.7777778">Landscape 16:9</option><option value=".8">Portrait 4:5</option></select></div>`}</div>${button(id==="compress"?"Compress & download":id==="resize"?"Resize & download":id==="convert"?"Convert & download":"Crop & download","processImage")}<p class="subtle" id="imgInfo"></p></div>`;
case"palette":return `<p class="subtle">Choose a starting colour. We'll build a five-colour palette around it.</p><div class="field-grid">${field("Base colour","baseColor","","color","#ff9278")}</div>${button("Generate palette")}<div id="swatches" class="swatches"></div>`;
case"gradient":return `<div class="field-grid">${field("Start colour","gradA","","color","#ff9278")}${field("End colour","gradB","","color","#8277e8")}<div class="field"><label>ANGLE</label><input id="gradAngle" type="range" min="0" max="360" value="120"></div></div><div id="gradientPreview" class="color-preview"></div><div class="result-box" id="gradientCode"></div>${button("Copy CSS","copyGradient","btn-secondary")}`;
case"qr":return `${field("Text or URL","qrText","https://example.com")}${button("Generate QR code")}<div id="qrOut" style="display:grid;place-items:center;padding:16px"></div>`;
case"password":return `<div class="field-grid">${field("Password length","passLength","","number","20")}${field("How many?","passCount","","number","1")}</div><div class="field"><label>INCLUDE</label><div class="btn-row"><label><input type="checkbox" id="upper" checked> Uppercase</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="lower" checked> Lowercase</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="digits" checked> Numbers</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="symbols" checked> Symbols</label></div></div>${button("Generate passwords")}${result()}`;
case"uuid":return `${field("Quantity","uuidCount","","number","5")}${button("Generate UUIDs")}${result()}`;
case"hash":return `${area("TEXT TO HASH","hashInput") }<div class="field"><label>ALGORITHM</label><select id="hashAlg"><option>SHA-256</option><option>SHA-1</option><option>SHA-384</option><option>SHA-512</option></select></div>${button("Generate hash")}${result()}`;
case"json":return `${area("JSON INPUT","jsonInput",'{ "hello": "world" }')}<div class="btn-row">${button("Format JSON","formatJson")}${button("Minify JSON","minifyJson","btn-secondary")}</div>${result()}`;
case"base64":return `${area("INPUT TEXT","baseInput") }<div class="btn-row">${button("Encode","encode64")}${button("Decode","decode64","btn-secondary")}</div>${result()}`;
case"url":return `${area("INPUT TEXT / URL","urlInput")}<div class="btn-row">${button("Encode","encodeUrl")}${button("Decode","decodeUrl","btn-secondary")}</div>${result()}`;
case"regex":return `${field("Regular expression","regexPattern","e.g. [A-Z]+")}${area("TEST TEXT","regexText")}<div class="field"><label>FLAGS</label><input id="regexFlags" value="gi" class="tool-input"></div>${button("Find matches")}${result()}`;
case"word":return `${area("YOUR TEXT","wordInput","Start typing or paste your text...")}<div class="quick-stats" style="margin:12px 0 0;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)"><div class="stat"><div><b id="words">0</b><small>WORDS</small></div></div><div class="stat"><div><b id="chars">0</b><small>CHARACTERS</small></div></div><div class="stat"><div><b id="sentences">0</b><small>SENTENCES</small></div></div><div class="stat"><div><b id="readtime">0m</b><small>READ TIME</small></div></div></div>`;
case"case":return `${area("TEXT TO TRANSFORM","caseInput")}<div class="btn-row"><button class="btn btn-primary" data-case="upper">UPPERCASE</button><button class="btn btn-secondary" data-case="lower">lowercase</button><button class="btn btn-secondary" data-case="title">Title Case</button><button class="btn btn-secondary" data-case="sentence">Sentence case</button><button class="btn btn-secondary" data-case="camel">camelCase</button><button class="btn btn-secondary" data-case="snake">snake_case</button></div>${result()}`;
case"lorem":return `${field("Paragraphs","loremCount","","number","3")}<div class="btn-row"><button class="btn btn-primary" id="loremPara">Generate paragraphs</button><button class="btn btn-secondary" id="loremWords">Generate 100 words</button></div>${result()}`;
case"markdown":return `<div class="field-grid">${area("MARKDOWN","mdInput","# Heading\\n\\nWrite **bold**, *italic*, and lists...")}<div class="field"><label>LIVE PREVIEW</label><div class="result-box" id="mdPreview" style="height:190px;overflow:auto"></div></div></div><p class="subtle">Basic Markdown preview. Raw HTML is escaped for safety.</p>`;
case"percentage":return `<div class="field"><label>CALCULATE WHAT % OF A NUMBER</label><div class="field-grid">${field("Percentage","pctA","","number","15")}${field("Number","pctB","","number","250")}</div></div><div class="btn-row">${button("Calculate","calcPct")}</div><div id="pctResult" class="metric-result">37.5</div><div class="subtle">You can also use the increase / decrease calculator below.</div><div class="field-grid">${field("Original value","pctOld","","number","100")}${field("New value","pctNew","","number","125")}</div>${button("Find percentage change","calcChange","btn-secondary")}${result()}`;
case"unit":return `<div class="field"><label>CONVERSION TYPE</label><select id="unitType"><option value="length">Length</option><option value="weight">Weight</option><option value="temp">Temperature</option></select></div>${field("Value","unitValue","","number","1")}<div class="field-grid"><div class="field"><label>FROM</label><select id="unitFrom"></select></div><div class="field"><label>TO</label><select id="unitTo"></select></div></div>${button("Convert")}${result()}`;
case"age":return `${field("Date of birth","birthDate","","date","2000-01-01")}${button("Calculate age")}${result()}`;
case"bmi":return `<div class="field-grid">${field("Height (cm)","heightCm","","number","170")}${field("Weight (kg)","weightKg","","number","65")}</div>${button("Calculate BMI")}<div id="bmiResult" class="metric-result">—</div><div id="bmiNote" class="subtle"></div>`;
case"tip":return `<div class="field-grid">${field("Bill amount (₹)","bill","","number","1200")}${field("Tip (%)","tipPct","","number","10")}${field("People","people","","number","3")}</div>${button("Split the bill")}<div id="tipResult" class="metric-result">₹440.00</div><div id="tipNote" class="subtle"></div>`;
case"loan":return `<div class="field-grid">${field("Loan amount (₹)","loanAmount","","number","500000")}${field("Annual interest (%)","loanRate","","number","9")}${field("Tenure (years)","loanYears","","number","5")}</div>${button("Calculate EMI")}<div id="loanResult" class="metric-result">—</div><div id="loanNote" class="subtle"></div>`;
case"timestamp":return `${field("Unix timestamp (seconds)","unixTime","e.g. 1700000000","","")}${button("Convert timestamp","toDate")}${result()}<div class="result-label">OR CONVERT DATE TO UNIX</div>${field("Date and time","dateTime","","datetime-local")}${button("Convert to timestamp","toUnix","btn-secondary")}`;
case"pomodoro":return `<div class="field-grid">${field("Focus minutes","focusMins","","number","25")}${field("Break minutes","breakMins","","number","5")}</div><div class="timer-display" id="focusDisplay">25:00</div><div class="progress-track"><i id="focusProgress"></i></div><div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:17px">${button("Start","focusStart")}${button("Pause","focusPause","btn-secondary")}${button("Reset","focusReset","btn-secondary")}</div><p class="subtle" id="focusLabel" style="text-align:center">FOCUS SESSION · TAKE IT ONE STEP AT A TIME</p>`;
case"stopwatch":return `<div class="timer-display" id="stopDisplay">00:00.00</div><div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center">${button("Start","stopStart")}${button("Lap","stopLap","btn-secondary")}${button("Reset","stopReset","btn-secondary")}</div><div id="laps" class="result-box">Your lap times will appear here.</div>`;
case"csv":return `<div class="dropzone"><strong>Open a CSV file</strong>Your spreadsheet is parsed locally.<input id="csvFile" type="file" accept=".csv,text/csv"></div><div class="field" style="margin-top:12px"><label>FILTER ROWS</label><input id="csvSearch" placeholder="Search table..." disabled></div><div id="csvTable" class="table-wrap"></div><button id="csvDownload" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top:10px" hidden>Download filtered CSV</button>`;
case"invoice":return `<div class="field-grid">${field("Your business","invBusiness","Studio / Company")}${field("Invoice number","invNumber","INV-001","text","INV-001")}${field("Bill to","invClient","Client name")}${field("Date","invDate","","date",new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10))}</div>${area("ITEMS (one per line: description, quantity, unit price)","invItems","Website design, 1, 12000\\nLogo design, 1, 5000")}<div class="field-grid">${field("Tax (%)","invTax","","number","0")}${field("Currency symbol","invCurrency","₹","text","₹")}</div>${button("Generate printable invoice","makeInvoice")}<div id="invoicePreview" class="result-box">Your invoice preview will appear here.</div>`;
case"favicon":return `<div class="field-grid">${field("Symbol or letter","favText","✦","text","✦")}<div class="field"><label>BACKGROUND</label><input id="favBg" type="color" value="#ff9278"></div><div class="field"><label>FOREGROUND</label><input id="favFg" type="color" value="#202438"></div></div><canvas id="favCanvas" width="256" height="256" style="width:128px;height:128px;border-radius:28px;display:block;margin:12px auto"></canvas>${button("Download PNG favicon","downloadFav")}`;
default:return `<p>Tool is coming soon.</p>`}}
function setResult(v){let el=$("#resultBox");if(el)el.textContent=String(v)}
function copyText(v){navigator.clipboard?.writeText(v).then(()=>toast("Copied to clipboard")).catch(()=>toast("Clipboard access unavailable","error"))}
function downloadBlob(blob,name){let a=document.createElement("a"),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.href=url;a.download=name;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)}
function wireTool(id){
if(["compress","resize","convert","crop"].includes(id)){let file=$("#imgFile"),img;file.onchange=()=>{let f=file.files[0];if(!f)return;img=new Image();img.onload=()=>{$("#imgControls").hidden=false;$("#imgPreview").src=img.src;$("#imgInfo").textContent=`Original: ${img.width} × ${img.height} · ${(f.size/1024).toFixed(1)} KB`};img.src=URL.createObjectURL(f)};$("#processImage").onclick=()=>{if(!img)return;let c=document.createElement("canvas"),w=img.width,h=img.height;if(id==="resize"){w=Math.max(1,+$("#width").value||w);h=Math.max(1,+$("#height").value||h)}if(id==="crop"){let r=$("#aspect").value,sw=img.width,sh=img.height;if(r!=="free"){r=+r;if(sw/sh>r)sw=sh*r;else sh=sw/r}c.width=Math.round(sw);c.height=Math.round(sh);c.getContext("2d").drawImage(img,(img.width-sw)/2,(img.height-sh)/2,sw,sh,0,0,sw,sh)}else{c.width=w;c.height=h;c.getContext("2d").drawImage(img,0,0,w,h)}let mime=id==="convert"?$("#format").value:"image/jpeg",q=id==="compress"?Math.min(1,Math.max(.1,+$("#quality").value||.78)):.9;c.toBlob(blob=>{downloadBlob(blob,`vexakit-${id}.${mime.split("/")[1]}`);$("#imgInfo").textContent=`Done · ${(blob.size/1024).toFixed(1)} KB · ${c.width} × ${c.height}`;toast("Image processed and downloaded")},mime,q)};return}
if(id==="palette"){$("#run").onclick=()=>{let base=$("#baseColor").value,hex=base.slice(1),n=parseInt(hex,16),r=n>>16,g=n>>8&255,b=n&255;let colors=[-32,-16,0,16,32].map(d=>[r,g,b].map(x=>Math.max(0,Math.min(255,x+d))).map(x=>x.toString(16).padStart(2,"0")).join(""));$("#swatches").innerHTML=colors.map(c=>`<div class="swatch" data-color="#${c}"><i style="background:#${c}"></i><span>#${c}</span></div>`).join("");$$(".swatch").forEach(s=>s.onclick=()=>copyText(s.dataset.color))};$("#run").click();return}
if(id==="gradient"){let update=()=>{let v=`linear-gradient(${$("#gradAngle").value}deg, ${$("#gradA").value}, ${$("#gradB").value})` ;$("#gradientPreview").style.background=v;$("#gradientCode").textContent=`background: ${v};`};["gradA","gradB","gradAngle"].forEach(x=>$("#"+x).oninput=update);update();$("#copyGradient").onclick=()=>copyText($("#gradientCode").textContent);return}
if(id==="qr"){$("#run").onclick=()=>{let text=$("#qrText").value.trim();if(!text)return toast("Enter text or a URL","error");if(!window.QRCode)return toast("QR library could not load. Check your internet connection.","error");$("#qrOut").innerHTML="";let box=document.createElement("div");box.style.cssText="background:white;padding:12px;border-radius:10px";$("#qrOut").append(box);new QRCode(box,{text,width:210,height:210,colorDark:"#171b2a",colorLight:"#ffffff",correctLevel:QRCode.CorrectLevel.H});setTimeout(()=>{let c=box.querySelector("canvas");if(c){let b64=c.toDataURL("image/png");let a=document.createElement("a");a.href=b64;a.download="vexakit-qr.png";a.textContent="Download QR PNG";a.className="btn btn-primary";a.style.marginTop="12px";$("#qrOut").append(a)}},120)};return}
if(id==="password"){$("#run").onclick=()=>{let len=Math.max(4,Math.min(128,+$("#passLength").value||20)),count=Math.max(1,Math.min(20,+$("#passCount").value||1)),sets=[];if($("#upper").checked)sets.push("ABCDEFGHJKLMNPQRSTUVWXYZ");if($("#lower").checked)sets.push("abcdefghijkmnopqrstuvwxyz");if($("#digits").checked)sets.push("23456789");if($("#symbols").checked)sets.push("!@#$%^&*()-_=+[]{}?");if(!sets.length)return toast("Select at least one character set","error");let all=sets.join(""),out=Array.from({length:count},()=>{let a=sets.map(s=>s[crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint32Array(1))[0]%s.length]);while(a.length<len)a.push(all[crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint32Array(1))[0]%all.length]);return a.sort(()=>Math.random()-.5).join("")});setResult(out.join("\n"));};return}
if(id==="uuid"){$("#run").onclick=()=>{let n=Math.max(1,Math.min(100,+$("#uuidCount").value||5));setResult(Array.from({length:n},()=>crypto.randomUUID()).join("\n"))};return}
if(id==="hash"){$("#run").onclick=async()=>{let data=new TextEncoder().encode($("#hashInput").value),alg=$("#hashAlg").value;let hash=await crypto.subtle.digest(alg,data);setResult([...new Uint8Array(hash)].map(b=>b.toString(16).padStart(2,"0")).join(""))};return}
if(id==="json"){let fn=min=>{try{let v=JSON.parse($("#jsonInput").value);setResult(JSON.stringify(v,null,min?0:2));}catch(e){setResult("Invalid JSON: "+e.message)}};$("#formatJson").onclick=()=>fn(false);$("#minifyJson").onclick=()=>fn(true);return}
if(id==="base64"){$("#encode64").onclick=()=>{try{setResult(btoa(unescape(encodeURIComponent($("#baseInput").value))))}catch(e){setResult(e.message)}};$("#decode64").onclick=()=>{try{setResult(decodeURIComponent(escape(atob($("#baseInput").value.trim()))))}catch(e){setResult("Invalid Base64 input")}};return}
if(id==="url"){$("#encodeUrl").onclick=()=>setResult(encodeURIComponent($("#urlInput").value));$("#decodeUrl").onclick=()=>{try{setResult(decodeURIComponent($("#urlInput").value))}catch(e){setResult("Invalid encoded URL")}};return}
if(id==="regex"){$("#run").onclick=()=>{try{let re=new RegExp($("#regexPattern").value,$("#regexFlags").value),txt=$("#regexText").value,matches=[...txt.matchAll(new RegExp(re.source,re.flags.includes("g")?re.flags:re.flags+"g"))];setResult(matches.length?matches.map((m,i)=>`${i+1}. "${m[0]}" at index ${m.index}`).join("\n"):`No matches found. (${matches.length})`)}catch(e){setResult("Regex error: "+e.message)}};return}
if(id==="word"){let fn=()=>{let t=$("#wordInput").value,words=t.trim()?t.trim().split(/\s+/).length:0;$("#words").textContent=words;$("#chars").textContent=t.length;$("#sentences").textContent=(t.match(/[.!?]+/g)||[]).length;$("#readtime").textContent=Math.ceil(words/200)+"m"};$("#wordInput").oninput=fn;return}
if(id==="case"){$$("[data-case]").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{let t=$("#caseInput").value,v=t;switch(b.dataset.case){case"upper":v=t.toUpperCase();break;case"lower":v=t.toLowerCase();break;case"title":v=t.toLowerCase().replace(/\b\w/g,c=>c.toUpperCase());break;case"sentence":v=t.toLowerCase().replace(/(^\s*\w|[.!?]\s+\w)/g,c=>c.toUpperCase());break;case"camel":v=t.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+(.)/g,(_,c)=>c.toUpperCase());break;case"snake":v=t.trim().toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g,"_").replace(/^_|_$/g,"")}setResult(v)});return}
if(id==="lorem"){let para=()=>{let s="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer posuere erat a ante venenatis dapibus posuere velit aliquet. Aenean eu leo quam. Pellentesque ornare sem lacinia quam venenatis vestibulum.";setResult(Array.from({length:Math.max(1,Math.min(20,+$("#loremCount").value||3))},()=>s).join("\n\n"))};$("#loremPara").onclick=para;$("#loremWords").onclick=()=>setResult(("Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipiscing elit sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua ").repeat(15).trim().split(/\s+/).slice(0,100).join(" "));return}
if(id==="markdown"){let esc=s=>s.replace(/[&<>]/g,c=>({"&":"&amp;","<":"&lt;",">":"&gt;"}[c]));let render=()=>{let s=esc($("#mdInput").value).split("\n").map(line=>line.startsWith("### ")?`<h3>${line.slice(4)}</h3>`:line.startsWith("## ")?`<h2>${line.slice(3)}</h2>`:line.startsWith("# ")?`<h1>${line.slice(2)}</h1>`:line.startsWith("- ")?`<li>${line.slice(2)}</li>`:line?`<p>${line.replace(/\*\*(.*?)\*\*/g,"<b>$1</b>").replace(/\*(.*?)\*/g,"<i>$1</i>")}</p>`:"").join("");$("#mdPreview").innerHTML=s};$("#mdInput").oninput=render;render();return}
if(id==="percentage"){$("#calcPct").onclick=()=>$("#pctResult").textContent=(+$("#pctA").value/100*+$("#pctB").value).toLocaleString();$("#calcChange").onclick=()=>{let a=+$("#pctOld").value,b=+$("#pctNew").value;setResult(a?`${((b-a)/a*100).toFixed(2)}% ${b>=a?"increase":"decrease"}`:"Original value cannot be zero")};return}
if(id==="unit"){let sets={length:{Meter:1,Kilometer:1000,Centimeter:.01,Millimeter:.001,Mile:1609.344,Foot:.3048,Inch:.0254},weight:{Kilogram:1,Gram:.001,Pound:.45359237,Ounce:.0283495},temp:{Celsius:0,Fahrenheit:1,Kelvin:2}};let populate=()=>{let s=sets[$("#unitType").value];$("#unitFrom").innerHTML=Object.keys(s).map(x=>`<option>${x}</option>`).join("");$("#unitTo").innerHTML=Object.keys(s).map(x=>`<option>${x}</option>`).join("");$("#unitTo").selectedIndex=1};$("#unitType").onchange=populate;populate();$("#run").onclick=()=>{let type=$("#unitType").value,v=+$("#unitValue").value,a=$("#unitFrom").value,b=$("#unitTo").value,out;if(type==="temp"){let c=a==="Celsius"?v:a==="Fahrenheit"?(v-32)*5/9:v-273.15;out=b==="Celsius"?c:b==="Fahrenheit"?c*9/5+32:c+273.15}else out=v*sets[type][a]/sets[type][b];setResult(`${out.toLocaleString(undefined,{maximumFractionDigits:6})} ${b}`)};return}
if(id==="age"){$("#run").onclick=()=>{let d=new Date($("#birthDate").value+"T00:00:00"),now=new Date();if(!$("#birthDate").value||d>now)return setResult("Enter a valid date in the past.");let y=now.getFullYear()-d.getFullYear(),m=now.getMonth()-d.getMonth(),day=now.getDate()-d.getDate();if(day<0){m--;day+=new Date(now.getFullYear(),now.getMonth(),0).getDate()}if(m<0){y--;m+=12}setResult(`${y} years, ${m} months and ${day} days`)};return}
if(id==="bmi"){$("#run").onclick=()=>{let h=+$("#heightCm").value/100,w=+$("#weightKg").value;if(!h||!w)return;let v=w/(h*h);$("#bmiResult").textContent=v.toFixed(1);$("#bmiNote").textContent=v<18.5?"Below the usual adult BMI range.":v<25?"Within the usual adult BMI range.":v<30?"Above the usual adult BMI range.":"In the higher adult BMI range. BMI is a screening measure, not a diagnosis."};return}
if(id==="tip"){$("#run").onclick=()=>{let bill=+$("#bill").value,tip=+$("#tipPct").value/100,n=Math.max(1,+$("#people").value);let each=bill*(1+tip)/n;$("#tipResult").textContent=`₹${each.toFixed(2)} each` ;$("#tipNote").textContent=`Tip: ₹${(bill*tip).toFixed(2)} · Total: ₹${(bill*(1+tip)).toFixed(2)} · ${n} people`};return}
if(id==="loan"){$("#run").onclick=()=>{let p=+$("#loanAmount").value,r=+$("#loanRate").value/1200,n=+$("#loanYears").value*12;if(!p||!n)return;let emi=r?p*r*Math.pow(1+r,n)/(Math.pow(1+r,n)-1):p/n,total=emi*n;$("#loanResult").textContent=`₹${emi.toLocaleString("en-IN",{maximumFractionDigits:2})} / month`;$("#loanNote").textContent=`Total payment ₹${total.toLocaleString("en-IN",{maximumFractionDigits:2})} · Interest ₹${(total-p).toLocaleString("en-IN",{maximumFractionDigits:2})}`};return}
if(id==="timestamp"){$("#toDate").onclick=()=>{let d=new Date(+$("#unixTime").value*1000);setResult(isNaN(d)?"Enter a valid timestamp":d.toLocaleString()+" · "+d.toISOString())};$("#toUnix").onclick=()=>{let d=new Date($("#dateTime").value);setResult(isNaN(d)?"Enter a valid date":Math.floor(d.getTime()/1000))};return}
if(id==="pomodoro"){let total=25*60,remaining=total,mode="focus";let display=()=>{$("#focusDisplay").textContent=`${String(Math.floor(remaining/60)).padStart(2,"0")}:${String(remaining%60).padStart(2,"0")}`;$("#focusProgress").style.width=((total-remaining)/total*100)+"%"};let reset=()=>{mode="focus";total=Math.max(1,+$("#focusMins").value||25)*60;remaining=total;$("#focusLabel").textContent="FOCUS SESSION · TAKE IT ONE STEP AT A TIME";display()};$("#focusStart").onclick=()=>{if(focusInterval)return;focusInterval=setInterval(()=>{remaining--;display();if(remaining<=0){clearInterval(focusInterval);focusInterval=null;mode=mode==="focus"?"break":"focus";total=(mode==="focus"?+$("#focusMins").value:+$("#breakMins").value)*60;remaining=total;$("#focusLabel").textContent=mode==="focus"?"FOCUS SESSION":"BREAK TIME · YOU EARNED IT";display();toast(mode==="break"?"Focus session complete — take a break!":"Break complete — ready for another round?")}},1000)};$("#focusPause").onclick=()=>{clearInterval(focusInterval);focusInterval=null};$("#focusReset").onclick=()=>{clearInterval(focusInterval);focusInterval=null;reset()};reset();return}
if(id==="stopwatch"){let tick=()=>{let ms=stopwatchState.elapsed+(stopwatchState.running?Date.now()-stopwatchState.start:0),m=Math.floor(ms/60000),s=Math.floor(ms/1000)%60,cs=Math.floor(ms/10)%100;$("#stopDisplay").textContent=`${String(m).padStart(2,"0")}:${String(s).padStart(2,"0")}.${String(cs).padStart(2,"0")}`};let timer=setInterval(()=>{if($("#stopDisplay"))tick();else clearInterval(timer)},30);$("#stopStart").onclick=()=>{if(!stopwatchState.running){stopwatchState.start=Date.now();stopwatchState.running=true}};$("#stopLap").onclick=()=>{if(!stopwatchState.running)return;let ms=stopwatchState.elapsed+Date.now()-stopwatchState.start;stopwatchState.laps.push(ms);$("#laps").textContent=stopwatchState.laps.map((v,i)=>`Lap ${i+1}  ${Math.floor(v/60000)}:${String(Math.floor(v/1000)%60).padStart(2,"0")}.${String(Math.floor(v/10)%100).padStart(2,"0")}`).join("\n")};$("#stopReset").onclick=()=>{stopwatchState={start:0,elapsed:0,running:false,laps:[]};$("#laps").textContent="Your lap times will appear here.";tick()};return}
if(id==="csv"){let rows=[];$("#csvFile").onchange=()=>{let f=$("#csvFile").files[0];if(!f)return;let r=new FileReader();r.onload=()=>{let text=r.result,lines=text.split(/\r?\n/).filter(Boolean),parse=line=>{let a=[],v="",q=false;for(let i=0;i<line.length;i++){let c=line[i];if(c==='"'&&line[i+1]==='"'){v+='"';i++}else if(c==='"')q=!q;else if(c===","&&!q){a.push(v);v=""}else v+=c}a.push(v);return a};rows=lines.map(parse);$("#csvSearch").disabled=false;renderCsv();$("#csvDownload").hidden=false};r.readAsText(f)};let renderCsv=()=>{let q=$("#csvSearch").value.toLowerCase(),filtered=rows.filter((r,i)=>i===0||r.join(" ").toLowerCase().includes(q));$("#csvTable").innerHTML=`<table>${filtered.slice(0,201).map((r,i)=>`<tr>${r.map(c=>i===0?`<th>${escapeHtml(c)}</th>`:`<td>${escapeHtml(c)}</td>`).join("")}</tr>`).join("")}</table><p class="subtle">Showing ${Math.max(0,filtered.length-1)} matching rows (max 200 shown).</p>`};$("#csvSearch").oninput=renderCsv;$("#csvDownload").onclick=()=>{let q=$("#csvSearch").value.toLowerCase(),data=rows.filter((r,i)=>i===0||r.join(" ").toLowerCase().includes(q)).map(r=>r.map(c=>`"${c.replace(/"/g,'""')}"`).join(",")).join("\n");downloadBlob(new Blob([data],{type:"text/csv"}),"filtered.csv")};return}
if(id==="invoice"){$("#makeInvoice").onclick=()=>{let sym=$("#invCurrency").value||"₹",lines=$("#invItems").value.split("\n").filter(Boolean).map(x=>{let a=x.split(",");return {name:a[0].trim(),qty:+a[1]||1,price:+a[2]||0}}),sub=lines.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.qty*x.price,0),tax=sub*(+$("#invTax").value||0)/100,total=sub+tax;let html=`<html><head><title>Invoice ${$("#invNumber").value}</title><style>body{font:14px Arial;padding:45px;color:#222}h1{font-size:34px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:30px 0}td,th{padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left}.right{text-align:right}.total{font-size:20px;font-weight:bold}</style></head><body><h1>INVOICE</h1><h2>${escapeHtml($("#invBusiness").value)}</h2><p>Invoice: ${escapeHtml($("#invNumber").value)}<br>Date: ${escapeHtml($("#invDate").value)}<br>Bill to: ${escapeHtml($("#invClient").value)}</p><table><tr><th>Description</th><th>Qty</th><th>Price</th><th class="right">Amount</th></tr>${lines.map(x=>`<tr><td>${escapeHtml(x.name)}</td><td>${x.qty}</td><td>${sym}${x.price.toFixed(2)}</td><td class="right">${sym}${(x.qty*x.price).toFixed(2)}</td></tr>`).join("")}</table><p class="right">Subtotal: ${sym}${sub.toFixed(2)}<br>Tax: ${sym}${tax.toFixed(2)}</p><p class="right total">Total: ${sym}${total.toFixed(2)}</p><script>window.onload=()=>window.print()<\/script></body></html>`;let w=window.open("","_blank");if(!w)return toast("Allow pop-ups to print invoice","error");w.document.write(html);w.document.close();$("#invoicePreview").textContent=`${lines.length} line items · Total ${sym}${total.toFixed(2)} · Print dialog opened.`};return}
if(id==="favicon"){let draw=()=>{let c=$("#favCanvas"),ctx=c.getContext("2d");ctx.fillStyle=$("#favBg").value;ctx.beginPath();ctx.roundRect(0,0,256,256,54);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle=$("#favFg").value;ctx.font="bold 150px sans-serif";ctx.textAlign="center";ctx.textBaseline="middle";ctx.fillText($("#favText").value||"✦",128,136)};["favText","favBg","favFg"].forEach(x=>$("#"+x).oninput=draw);draw();$("#downloadFav").onclick=()=>$("#favCanvas").toBlob(b=>downloadBlob(b,"favicon.png"));return}
}
function escapeHtml(s){return String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({"&":"&amp;","<":"&lt;",">":"&gt;",'"':"&quot;","'":"&#39;"}[c]))}
function toggleTheme(){let t=document.documentElement.dataset.theme==="light"?"dark":"light";document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t;save("theme",t);["#themeToggle","#toolThemeToggle"].forEach(sel=>{let el=$(sel);if(el)el.textContent=t==="light"?"☾":"☼"})}
$("#themeToggle").onclick=toggleTheme;$("#toolThemeToggle").onclick=toggleTheme;
let theme=load("theme","dark");document.documentElement.dataset.theme=theme;["#themeToggle","#toolThemeToggle"].forEach(sel=>{let el=$(sel);if(el)el.textContent=theme==="light"?"☾":"☼"});
$("#favoriteTool").onclick=()=>currentTool&&toggleFav(currentTool.id);$("#closeTool").onclick=closeTool;$("#toolOverlay").onclick=e=>{if(e.target===$("#toolOverlay"))closeTool()};$("#resetTool").onclick=()=>currentTool&&openTool(currentTool.id);
$("#mainSearch").oninput=e=>{if(currentView!=="home")setView("home");search=e.target.value;activeFilter="All";renderTools()};$("#shortcutSearch").onclick=()=>{if(currentView!=="home")setView("home");$("#mainSearch").focus();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:"smooth"})};$("#mainSearch").onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==="Enter"){let t=filtered()[0];if(t)navigateTool(t.id)}};$("#clearSearch").onclick=()=>{search="";activeFilter="All";$("#mainSearch").value="";setView("home")};
$("#filterRow").onclick=e=>{let b=e.target.closest("[data-filter]");if(!b)return;activeFilter=b.dataset.filter;search="";$("#mainSearch").value="";renderTools()};
$$(".nav-item[data-view]").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{if(b.dataset.view==="home"){activeFilter="All";search="";$("#mainSearch").value=""}setView(b.dataset.view);$("#sidebar").classList.remove("open")});
$("#gridView").onclick=()=>{listMode=false;$("#gridView").classList.add("selected");$("#listView").classList.remove("selected");$("#toolsGrid").classList.remove("list-view")};$("#listView").onclick=()=>{listMode=true;$("#listView").classList.add("selected");$("#gridView").classList.remove("selected");$("#toolsGrid").classList.add("list-view")};
$("#menuBtn").onclick=()=>$("#sidebar").classList.add("open");$("#mobileClose").onclick=()=>$("#sidebar").classList.remove("open");
document.addEventListener("keydown",e=>{if((e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)&&e.key.toLowerCase()==="k"){e.preventDefault();if(currentView!=="home")setView("home");$("#mainSearch").focus()}if((e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)&&e.key==="1"){e.preventDefault();activeFilter="All";search="";$("#mainSearch").value="";setView("home")}if(e.key==="Escape"){closeTool();$("#sidebar").classList.remove("open")}});
renderCats();renderFeatured();renderTools();$("#toolCount").textContent=tools.length+"+";applyLanguage(load("language","en"));
const requestedTool=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get("tool");if(requestedTool&&tools.some(t=>t.id===requestedTool)){const pageTool=tools.find(t=>t.id===requestedTool);document.title=`${pageTool.name} — VexaKit`;openTool(requestedTool);$("#crumbCurrent").textContent=pageTool.name;}
if("serviceWorker"in navigator&&location.protocol!=="file:")window.addEventListener("load",()=>navigator.serviceWorker.register("./service-worker.js").catch(()=>{}));
